{
  "protocol": "Protocol: every row is trained on the same data (5.0B tokens of the P2 track's DCLM manifest) with the same schedule (4,769 updates of 1,048,576 tokens, warmup-stable-decay) and seed 42. Learning rate: tuned once per optimizer on the ordinary MoE (AdamW 1.2e-3, Muon 1.7e-3; [#180](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/180)); the same grid on the shared middle loop, at the end of the chain, selects the same value. Every other row inherits it without a search of its own; the one later learning-rate check, for one row under AdamW, is reported in a note and not used in the table.",
  "not_shown": "This page shows a subset of the Phase 1 record. Other configurations trained with the same protocol are not shown: `phase1/m1`, `phase1/m1s`, `phase1/m2` and `phase1/m6` ([#200](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/200)), `phase1/m4-elr` and `phase1/m7-elr` ([#266](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/266)), `shape/m0r` ([#218](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/218)), `shape/d24` and `shape/d36` ([#242](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/242)), `shape/m0lr` and `shape/m0i` ([#252](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/252)). The studies are [#177](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/177), [#216](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/216) and [#225](https://github.com/datamllab/LoopTitan/issues/225).",
